# Known-accepted image findings for the CI trivy scan (CRITICAL/HIGH).
#
# One entry per line: a CVE id or a vulnerability matcher, with the reason and an
# expiry note above it. An empty file means the image is expected to scan clean --
# that is the default, and a red scan is the correct answer until a finding is
# either fixed or recorded here with a reason.
#
# Example (deliberally commented out so this file cannot silently swallow findings):
# CVE-2099-00000  # pinned by <dependency>, upstream fix blocked by <reason>; revisit <date>
